%% title: The steps of a final result
%% desc: A final result starts as a Draft when you press Start. You choose which exams count and how much each counts, then build the results. After you check them, you publish. Guardians then see the result and you can send the SMS and print the cards. Reopening needs extra approval and puts the result back to Built.
flowchart LR
  D["Draft<br/>choose exams and shares"]:::note -->|"Build results"| P["Built<br/>only the school sees it"]:::admin
  P -->|"Build again"| P
  P -->|"Publish"| U["Published<br/>guardians can see"]:::guardian
  U -->|"Send SMS"| M["SMS on the<br/>guardian's phone"]:::guardian
  U -->|"Print"| C["Report cards and<br/>tabulation sheet"]:::guardian
  U -->|"Reopen<br/>extra approval"| P
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
